 "description": "The Ki-27 otsu is of the 4th Sentai based in the Japanese Tachiarai Air Base, located in Fukuoka, Kyūshū. Established in 1919 and in 1940 as an Army Flight School, it trained all new Army pilots to be ready for aerial combat over the skies of Asia. The Ki-27 otsu (4th Sentai) was introduced in Update \"Starfighters\" . Serving as a very good example of what to expect from the Japanese air tree, the Ki-27 excels in manoeuvrability above all else, having average survivability with lacklustre firepower.",
